    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Against Time Challenging Mystery Solving Game</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.poster.avif?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.webm?t=1709798169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.mp4?t=1709798169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/69cf737c907c40a3774ade5b931ce66a.webp?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br>The Cadet Files: Scene Unseen is a unique interactive detective game crafted for enthusiasts of mystery and detective genres. As a trainee agent on the verge of graduation, you dive into a world of intricate crimes and captivating mysteries. This game blends critical thinking, observation, and interactive storytelling, offering an immersive experience for players of all levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/b70a445ab339fd01e0df36264f6fde1a.webp?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br>Engaging Detective Gameplay: Solve complex crimes using your primary tool \u2013 a tablet loaded with clues and puzzles.<br>Diverse Scenarios: Each level presents a distinct crime scene, demanding sharp observation and deductive reasoning.<br>Interactive Puzzle Solving: Uncover hidden objects, capture significant photographs, and solve challenging puzzles.<br>Progressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles and scenarios grow more complex, mirroring an agent\u2019s journey from novice to master detective.<br>Immersive Storytelling: Engage in a narrative where each decision and discovery leads to new paths and outcomes.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Against Time Challenging Mystery Solving Game</h2></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.poster.avif?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.webm?t=1709798169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/349c5912de97352205fcf3aa5b07c404.mp4?t=1709798169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/69cf737c907c40a3774ade5b931ce66a.webp?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br>The Cadet Files: Scene Unseen is a unique interactive detective game crafted for enthusiasts of mystery and detective genres. As a trainee agent on the verge of graduation, you dive into a world of intricate crimes and captivating mysteries. This game blends critical thinking, observation, and interactive storytelling, offering an immersive experience for players of all levels.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2711330/extras/b70a445ab339fd01e0df36264f6fde1a.webp?t=1709798169\" width=600 height=50 /></span><br><br>Engaging Detective Gameplay: Solve complex crimes using your primary tool \u2013 a tablet loaded with clues and puzzles.<br>Diverse Scenarios: Each level presents a distinct crime scene, demanding sharp observation and deductive reasoning.<br>Interactive Puzzle Solving: Uncover hidden objects, capture significant photographs, and solve challenging puzzles.<br>Progressive Difficulty: As you advance, the puzzles and scenarios grow more complex, mirroring an agent\u2019s journey from novice to master detective.<br>Immersive Storytelling: Engage in a narrative where each decision and discovery leads to new paths and outcomes.",
    "short_description": "Against Time Challenging Mystery Solving GameNavigate crime scenes in 'The Cadet Files: Scene Unseen', using your tablet to solve puzzles and find hidden objects. Test your detective skills in a world of intrigue! Unravel mysteries, master new challenges,progress through levels.",
